tasti man LH</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1176845-pentex-employee-indoctrination-manual-now-on-drpg?p=1177434#post1177434\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Neither am I, but from what I heard the backer PDF link was sent awhile ago. Way back at the end of November 2017.<br /> <br /> Were you away from your computer around that time?</div> </div> </div> </div>That's strange, because I check my email every day. Now I'm checking my enter box and my spam box, but there are nothing...last email I receveid are about the dice rolling app.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":10047,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10047-vis\u00e3o-de-\u00e1guia","user":"Vis\u00e3o-de-\u00c1guia","date":". 01-19-2018, 06:31 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10047-vis\u00e3o-de-\u00e1guia","name":"Vis\u00e3o-de-\u00c1guia","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar10047_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"29"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-01-19T15:30:38-08:00","id":1177439,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Vis\u00e3o-de-\u00c1guia</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1176845-pentex-employee-indoctrination-manual-now-on-drpg?p=1177438#post1177438\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> That's strange, because I check my email every day. Now I'm checking my enter box and my spam box, but there are nothing...</div> </div> </div> </div>Might want to contact <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5-richt\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar5_2.jpeg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"5\" data-vbnamecard=\"5\">RichT</a> or someone else via the KS page to see if you can get things sorted out on getting your PDF.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4418-tasti-man-lh","name":"tasti man LH","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4418_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1850"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-01-20T03:48:14-08:00","id":1177553,"title":"","content":"Ok, post here because the link was sent, not by email, but by the kickstarter page. So, if you not receive the link check your messages in your kickstarter profile.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10047-vis\u00e3o-de-\u00e1guia","name":"Vis\u00e3o-de-\u00c1guia","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar10047_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"29"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-01-22T05:36:50-08:00","id":1178045,"title":"","content":"Just got it. Reading it now.<br /> So far, I think someone had some fun writing it, and it's clear to anyone who's read enough books that pentex don't hand out books like that for everything they've got, But I've got to say I object to how much it accepts the supernatural in it's workplace. Up till now, I was under the impression that everything had been given very technical sounding name and there was a lot of (official) denial in how much was supernatural, Kind of like how the technocracy works (it's science, we swear!). I get it's a satirical company, but a little too tongue in cheek. <br /> <br /> Also, I really object to how anti-discrimination warnings regarding sexual orientation and gender identity are with supernatural breeds of evil. It's poorly written and sends the wrong message. Have some tact.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Be correct.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23728-pewpew","name":"PewPew","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"107"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-01-22T11:00:46-08:00","id":1178109,"title":"","content":"It's not dreadful. but overall it's not good. I think there's more on pentex in the book of the wyrm than there is here. The satire is weak in some sections. The section on video games for instance is really.. wrong. a problem with video games is that they often <b><i>don't</i></b> put much thought into detail, and murdering half your employees to get the gore right is not a clever farce. More importantly, actual, real criticism of the game industry (how publishers can screw over smaller developers working for them to swallow them up) just ain't there. Someone definitely had fun writing the first few sections, BTKs and the following were inspiring stuff, but a lot of stuff just felt like the writers were really stretching. The writing often felt bland and I didn't get the impression that people had insider knowledge on how things work. Much of it was just bland. Not god awful, I'll note my few standout problems, but for the most part the book varied between good and endurable.<br /> <br /> television enticers is the standout absolutely terrible idea. Do you not see the problem with thousands of people attracted to the same person and having radically different accounts of how they look?<br /> On-site everything was used in basically every chapter, and it was boring to read so many times. I get that you're all freelancers, but this was poor planning. <br /> I'm disapointed by the lack of content. BTKs and werewolf killing schemes were great stuff, Sunburst using it's stuff to track garou... Interesting, though unlikely to get past the garou nation for long. But there's a real lack of mechanics, new items, cool things,technical details, new companies and products... which brings on to my second point; <br /> The book doesn't really have that strong of an Identity. Obviously, it doesn't appear to be a handbook, but it ain't a rule-book, and the narrations vary in style. It can't decide how evil it wants to seem, nor does it seem to know who it's addressing. <br /> <b>The original artwork is stellar</b>. I must admit I'm somewhat torn now between the classic red goggles and the more realistic, tactical, modern stuff we have depicted here. <br /> &quot;Randal Mudrock&quot; is in it. Great stuff.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Be correct.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23728-pewpew","name":"PewPew","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"107"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-01-22T11:43:32-08:00","id":1178124,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>PewPew</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1176845-pentex-employee-indoctrination-manual-now-on-drpg?p=1178109#post1178109\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">It's not dreadful. but overall it's not good. I think there's more on pentex in the book of the wyrm than there is here.</div> </div> </div> </div><div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> But there's a real lack of mechanics, new items, cool things,technical details, new companies and products... </div> </div> </div>...I think you missed the point of what this book is. <br /> <br /> It\u2019s NOT meant to be a replacement for the Pentex section in Book of the Wyrm W20. It\u2019s NOT supposed to have crunch material to sink into. <br /> <br /> It\u2019s an in-game prop. <br /> <br /> It\u2019s supposed to be the kind of thing that you leave for the PC pack to find in a Pentex office they just raided, for them to brush up on the state of Pentex and get an insight into their current anti-garou tactics. And out-of-game, implied plot hooks for an ST to use.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4418-tasti-man-lh","name":"tasti man LH","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4418_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1850"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-01-22T11:53:14-08:00","id":1178132,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>tasti man LH</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1176845-pentex-employee-indoctrination-manual-now-on-drpg?p=1178124#post1178124\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> It\u2019s supposed to be the kind of thing that you leave for the PC pack to find in a Pentex office they just raided, for them to brush up on the state of Pentex and get an insight into their current anti-garou tactics. And out-of-game, implied plot hooks for an ST to use.</div> </div> </div> </div>If it's just implied plot hooks for the ST, there's some great stuff mixed in with the rest. If it's everything else you just said, then you must've read something different.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Be correct.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23728-pewpew","name":"PewPew","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"107"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-01-22T12:12:57-08:00","id":1178141,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>PewPew</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1176845-pentex-employee-indoctrination-manual-now-on-drpg?p=1178132#post1178132\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">If it's just implied plot hooks for the ST, there's some great stuff mixed in with the rest. If it's everything else you just said, then you must've read something different.</div> </div> </div> </div>I don't know what to tell you then.<br /> <br /> Because I never got the impression this was supposed to be *THE* Pentex W20 update that was supposed to blow the Pentex chapter in Book of the Wyrm W20 out of the water. 'Cause I like that Pentex chapter quite a lot. That this is just a supplementary piece to that chapter and nothing more.<br /> <br /> Unless if you could direct me to the advertising text that says otherwise?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4418-tasti-man-lh","name":"tasti man LH","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4418_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1850"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-01-23T08:20:51-08:00","id":1178438,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>tasti man LH</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1176845-pentex-employee-indoctrination-manual-now-on-drpg?p=1178141#post1178141\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I don't know what to tell you then.<br /> <br /> Because I never got the impression this was supposed to be *THE* Pentex W20 update that was supposed to blow the Pentex chapter in Book of the Wyrm W20 out of the water. 'Cause I like that Pentex chapter quite a lot. That this is just a supplementary piece to that chapter and nothing more.<br /> <br /> Unless if you could direct me to the advertising text that says otherwise?</div> </div> </div> </div>Nope, you're correct.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b><span style=\"color:#000080\">Matthew Dawkins</span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000080\">In-House Developer for Onyx Path Publishing</span></b><br /> <br /> <i><span style=\"font-family:arial\"><b><span style=\"color:#008080\">Website: </span><a href=\"http://www.matthewdawkins.com\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#008080\">https://www.matthewdawkins.com</span></a><br /> <span style=\"color:#008080\">Patreon: </span><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/matthewdawkins\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#008080\">https://www.patreon.com/matthewdawkins</span></a></b></span></i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/152-the-gentleman-gamer","name":"The Gentleman Gamer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar152_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":6,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1698"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}